.TH YGGDRASIL\-EVIDENCE 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 6b26b19a" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
yggdrasil\-evidence \- Validate, sign and verify Yggdrasil signed\-manifest evidence packs.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B yggdrasil\-evidence
SUBCOMMAND [OPTION]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate, sign and verify Yggdrasil signed\-manifest evidence packs.
The full spec is nix/yggdrasil/evidence\-pack/README.md; operator runbooks are in nix/yggdrasil/evidence\-pack/runbooks/.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B validate
validate manifest.yaml against the schema
.TP
.B sign
sign manifest.yaml, image.iso.sha256 or a custody entry (ML\-DSA\-65 build key)
.TP
.B pubkey
derive build.pubkey from the build key seed (generates nothing)
.TP
.B verify
full evidence\-pack verification (signature, ISO, gates)
.TP
.B verify\-signature
check the manifest signature only
.TP
.B verify\-iso
check the ISO hash against the manifest only
.TP
.B verify\-gates
check the CI gates from the manifest only
.TP
.B verify\-custody
check the chain\-of\-custody log only
.TP
.B diff
diff two evidence packs
.TP
.B cask sign
seal a Sealed Cask's BINDING_RUNE.sha256 with the build key
.TP
.B cask verify
verify a Sealed Cask (also: the standalone cask\-verify)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXIT STATUS
Exit codes: 0 ok, 1 verification failed, 2 usage or unreadable input.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
